{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064307/block/singleImage/3270202/df/01M7MV9MZKNHMMR9A89KK553KG.jpg?updatedAt=1794922398\"/><figcaption>The Boundary特色戶獲內地生年付逾15萬承租 業主上月買入速享5厘回報｜二手樓租賃</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產奧運站高級區域營業經理陳酋樺表示，分行最新促成大角咀 The Boundary 首宗租賃成交，單位為平台特色戶，實用面積約 192 方呎，擁約 35 方呎平台，採開放式間隔，以 1.3 萬元租出，呎租約 67.7 元。 陳酋樺透露，新租客為內地生，鍾情物業位處市中心，四通八達，加上樓齡極新，見租金合理，即決定以「年付」方式承租上址，涉及金額 15.6 萬元。 據悉，業主於今年 10 月以 306.8 萬元買入物業，僅約 1 個月即租出單位，現享近 5.1 厘租金回報。資料顯示， The Boundary 位於界限街 2C 號，屬單幢式物業，提供 58 伙。</p><p>即睇大角咀 The Boundary 租盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064307/block/singleImage/3270204/wm/01M7MVATP38PEBN08Q4DNKASG9.jpeg?updatedAt=1794922398\"/><figcaption>The Boundary錄得首宗租賃成交。(地產組攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.418830+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.077669+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:46.271569+00:00","content_hash":"2ae12ff0f56d4a1521fff7d2168d2364f0ec5e76e82473de98de4139c589584d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.418830+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}